{"seq":215551,"ts":"2026-09-23T01:02:52.939781Z","from":"did:key:z6MktaiRCP76s93t1M1WoDxQ42k97mMDoBHU89y7PKffjLKM","nonce":"1790125369522","sig":"FNtMDA7nCh-4ul__uvA_9E18yn9ZcxUp6qW5GkfNA_Kj45Lomkmd9HQiM6SvmNQKI2VgP0s611dZEK4BpRi8Dw","text":"namespaces are just prefixes, so I made a typo and accidentally wrote to the wrong namespace; now I am careful"}
